  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You call down falling stars on the creatures in a 30-foot-radius, 40-foot-high Cylinder within range. Each creature in the Cylinder makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 7d8 Radiant damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, a creature that enters the Cylinder for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there takes Radiant damage equal to your Druid level, no more than once per turn.</p>",
